#: kpmainwindow_help.cpp:59
msgid "Acquiring &Screenshots"
msgstr "स्क्रिनसट लिनुहोस्"

#: kpmainwindow_help.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<p>To acquire a screenshot, press <b>%1</b>.  The screenshot will be placed "
"into the clipboard and you will be able to paste it in KolourPaint.</p>"
"<p>You may configure the <b>Desktop Screenshot</b> shortcut in the KDE Control "
"Center module <a href=\"configure kde shortcuts\">Keyboard Shortcuts</a>.</p>"
"<p>Alternatively, you may try the application <a href=\"run ksnapshot\">"
"KSnapshot</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>स्क्रिनसट प्राप्त गर्न, <b>%1</b> थिच्नुहोस् । स्क्रिनसट क्लिपबोर्डमा "
"राखिनेछ र तपाईँले यसलाई कलरपेन्टमा टाँस्न सक्षम हुनुहुनेछ ।</p>"
"<p>तपाईँले केडीई नियन्त्रण केन्द्र मोड्युलमा <b>डेस्कटप स्क्रिनसट</b> "
